OL,3,GNEWSAAll-terrain mobility scooters
OL,4,Aoffering freedom
OL,5,
OL,6,FWheelchair users are enjoying newfound
OL,7,Ffreedom as a fleet of all-terrain
OL,8,Fdisability scooters are making it
OL,9,Feasier to access the great outdoors.
OL,11,FThere are 39 beauty spots and
OL,12,Fattractions around south-west England
OL,13,Fthat offer the trampers for hire,
OL,14,Fincluding one on Lundy, with 60 sites
OL,15,Fnationwide.
OL,17,FThe hire scheme run by charity
OL,18,FDisability Together for a small charge,
OL,19,Fis intended to encourage independence
OL,20,Fand boost inclusivity.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
