OL,3,GNEWSAAll-terrain mobility scooters
OL,4,Aoffering freedom
OL,5,
OL,6,FWheelchair user Kate Wass said: "The
OL,7,Ftramper is my legs. I don't want the
OL,8,Fcountryside changing... but I want to
OL,9,Fbe able to access it, and be like
OL,10,Feverybody else".
